# 统一行尾为 LF，杜绝 Windows/Web 上传带来的 CRLF 差异噪音（diff 只显真实改动）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the vendored SHA-2 source byte-identical to its locked upstream package.
vendor/noble-hashes-2.4.0/sha2.js whitespace=-blank-at-eol

# 二进制：不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
